    "note": "Measured, not gated (spec \u00a75.1): the shipped relief surface sits this far ABOVE decimetre-class laser ground. The headline is the median over the 2 DISTINCT reference ground tracks, each of which is itself the median of that track's passes \u2014 the 31 passes re-fly the same few ground tracks (spec \u00a73), so pooling them would weight one geometry by how often it was re-flown. It is a smoothed DSM by its own note, and it is used by nothing in the heat model; the height comparison takes its ground line from the photons, never from the DEM."
